From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Breunig <christian@breunig.cc>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 09:32:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] debian: drop mlnx-ofed-kernel-dkms install file

The dkms package is excluded by the "modules" build profile, but
dh_install still evaluates the install files of all packages to support
dh_missing. This file is a dh-exec script and dh-exec is only a build
dependency outside of the "modules" profile, so building with -Pmodules
fails unless dh-exec happens to be installed.

The dkms package is never built, drop its install file.
---
 debian/mlnx-ofed-kernel-dkms.install | 11 -----------
 1 file changed, 11 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100755 debian/mlnx-ofed-kernel-dkms.install

diff --git a/debian/mlnx-ofed-kernel-dkms.install b/debian/mlnx-ofed-kernel-dkms.install
deleted file mode 100755
index d116b98..0000000
--- a/debian/mlnx-ofed-kernel-dkms.install
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,11 +0,0 @@
-#!/usr/bin/dh-exec
-source/compat*			usr/src/${pname}-${dkms_version}
-source/include			usr/src/${pname}-${dkms_version}
-source/drivers			usr/src/${pname}-${dkms_version}
-source/fs			usr/src/${pname}-${dkms_version}
-source/net			usr/src/${pname}-${dkms_version}
-source/backports		usr/src/${pname}-${dkms_version}
-source/backports_applied	usr/src/${pname}-${dkms_version}
-source/ofed_scripts		usr/src/${pname}-${dkms_version}
-source/COPYING			usr/src/${pname}-${dkms_version}
-source/debian/changelog		usr/src/${pname}-${dkms_version}/debian
-- 
2.39.5

